299 and sase [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]0.18.0 installs from PyPI. The release-wait phase closes its bead [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]on every path that does not need a human. The land agent confirms [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the release before it lands, and repairs the release itself when [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]something unexpected blocks it.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]v0_18_0_green_ci_release.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/v0_18_0_green_ci_release.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-1lh[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-1lh/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Fix every Master Gate red at master HEAD[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]gate-fix[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate-fix: clear the mypy, docs-test, and docs-lint reds the docs [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]restructuring left on master, then prove every lint-job step locally.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Fix the deterministic visual-test failures[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]visual-drift[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visual-drift: repair the two goldens that fail on every run and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]CI-only agents-deck readiness timeouts.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop one-off capture drift from failing the visual lane[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]visual-stability[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visual-stability: apply the accepted visual_flakes policy so a capture [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]race no longer reds Full CI by itself.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Fix the perf-floor flake and the Full CI time budget[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]ci-budget[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ci-budget: recalibrate the Phase 7E perf ceiling that fails about 30% of[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]runs, and check every Full CI job's headroom against its timeout.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Harden tools/release_watch so its bead close is guaranteed[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]watcher[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]watcher: make every exit path close the bead even under a process-group [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]kill, and end the watch early on a stuck red Master Gate.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Watch v0.18.0 to PyPI without editing files[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]release-watch[dim] · [dim][/dim]after gate-fix, visual-drift, visual-stability, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]ci-budget, watcher[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]release-watch: make no edits, preflight the hardened watcher, monitor it[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]until a verdict, and always close with an honest verdict.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1lh","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1lh.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-863caa6ec1e2b24aae111df1f3699dbc","started_at":"2026-10-16T17:03:11.098254+00:00","state":"